WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Reference, body and text inputs, recorded hands, and generated hands.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Placing a plate on a scale. The right hand sets the plate down, then presses the scale button.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.633
Right hand · Place the plate onto the platform of the scale.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.400
Right hand · Press the button on the scale.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Screwing on a bottle cap. Watch the left index finger extend as the hands turn the cap.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.500
Right hand · Screw the cap onto the green and yellow striped bottle.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Both hands · Screw the cap onto the green and yellow striped bottle.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Removing a USB stick. Watch the fingers of the right hand curl as the stick is removed.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.100
Left hand · Remove the usb stick from the usb hub.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.500
Both hands · Remove the usb stick from the usb hub.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Lighting an alcohol burner. Watch the right wrist turn as the hand moves to light the burner.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.467
Both hands · Uncap the alcohol burner.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.000
Right hand · Uncap the alcohol burner.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.000
Right hand · Ignite the alcohol burner with the ignitor.
